"Design and build Presence and Morale: entities exert presence; factions hold morale; morale-boosting (rally) actions exist; when an enemy's presence exceeds the morale of everyone present in your faction, you are forced into the cowering stance. Connects to stance-and-armament-loadout-system: cowering is already a forced stance there; presence-vs-morale is a forcing SOURCE feeding the same property-gated stance-forcing contest, and its exit condition (presence drops or morale rises) is condition-based like a status effect lifecycle. Recorded 2026-08-12 at user request; design work deferred -- separate from the loadout design phase."